---
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
import { site, legalEntity } from '~/lib/site';
const updated = '2026-04-19';
---

<Base title="Terms" description="Terms of use for Glitch Executor Labs." pageType="WebPage">
  <section class="container-app py-20 max-w-prose-tight">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-subtle text-fluid-sm">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="prose mt-10 text-muted [&_h2]:text-fg [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:mb-3 [&_h2]:text-fluid-xl [&_p]:my-3 [&_strong]:text-fg [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_li]:my-1.5 [&_a]:text-brand">
      <p>
        {site.parent} is a brand of <strong>{legalEntity.name}</strong>, a
        {legalEntity.type.toLowerCase()} owned by {legalEntity.owner} at
        {legalEntity.address}. By accessing {site.domain} you agree to
        these Terms. This page covers <em>only the portfolio site itself</em> —
        each sub-brand (Glitch Trade, Glitch Edge, Glitch Grow) ships its own
        product-specific Terms covering subscription fees, API usage, data
        processing, and dispute resolution for that product.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Informational site</h2>
      <p>
        This site is informational. It does not sell products or services
        directly; the sub-brand subdomains do. Nothing on this site is an
        offer, a recommendation, or advice of any kind.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Marks &amp; content</h2>
      <p>
        "Glitch Executor Labs", "Glitch Trade", "Glitch Edge", "Glitch Grow",
        {legalEntity.name}, the cobra mascot, and related marks are property
        of {legalEntity.name}. Copy, screenshots, and visual assets are
        copyrighted and cannot be reproduced commercially without written
        permission.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        Links from this site to <code>trade.glitchexecutor.com</code>,
        <code>edge.glitchexecutor.com</code>, <code>grow.glitchexecutor.com</code>,
        the GitHub repos listed, and external resources are provided for
        convenience. Each destination carries its own terms and privacy
        policy; we are not responsible for third-party content.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The site is provided <em>as-is</em> and <em>as-available</em>,
        without warranties of any kind. Historical performance of client
        engagements on the sub-brand sites is not a guarantee of future
        results for your account.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, {legalEntity.name}
        is not liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, special,
        exemplary, or punitive damages arising from use of this site.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Governing law &amp; dispute resolution</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms are governed by the laws of the
        <strong>{legalEntity.jurisdiction}</strong> and the federal laws of
        Canada applicable therein. Any dispute arising out of this site
        shall be finally resolved by <strong>binding arbitration</strong>
        administered by <strong>{legalEntity.arbitrationRules}</strong>,
        seated in <strong>{legalEntity.arbitrationSeat}</strong>, by a
        single arbitrator, in English. Nothing overrides non-waivable
        consumer rights under Ontario's Consumer Protection Act, 2002 or
        equivalent applicable law.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        <a href={`mailto:${legalEntity.email}`}>{legalEntity.email}</a>
      </p>
      <p class="font-mono text-fluid-sm">
        {legalEntity.name}<br/>
        Attention: {legalEntity.owner}<br/>
        {legalEntity.address}<br/>
        Tel: {legalEntity.phone}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
